    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "d941fa36-0d07-3781-b40b-705b630aeb2b",
                "word": "Bigfoot",
                "pos": "name",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e58f52e5-e2c7-3651-aaf2-b13a4db7ec43",
                        "entry_id": "d941fa36-0d07-3781-b40b-705b630aeb2b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A very large, hairy, humanoid creature, similar to the yeti, said to live in the wilderness areas of the United States and Canada, especially the Pacific Northwest."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "572a0d96-300a-4af8-b49d-acee9d044a75",
                                "sense_id": "e58f52e5-e2c7-3651-aaf2-b13a4db7ec43",
                                "text": "This imprint was made either Wednesday night or early Thursday morning by \"Big Foot\"."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bc1fcdce-bc14-482e-9aab-42b258ed8367",
                                "sense_id": "e58f52e5-e2c7-3651-aaf2-b13a4db7ec43",
                                "text": "Stories of “Bigfoot,” an eight-foot denizen of the forest in Northern California’s wild Trinity County, are among the main topics of conversation in that area. He is supposedly an Indian or half-breed who has reverted to an animal existence. A footprint believed to be his was measured by a Redding shoe store owner and found to be size 24!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "38cad1c3-65af-4bbb-a63f-6ace24019300",
                                "sense_id": "e58f52e5-e2c7-3651-aaf2-b13a4db7ec43",
                                "text": "Some Earth people believe Bigfoot lives in underground caves; others believe Bigfoot is connected with extraterrestrials; still others believe Bigfoot is a spirit that can sometimes manifest in form."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "20c92238-a53c-4232-9244-c4ba66996392",
                                "sense_id": "e58f52e5-e2c7-3651-aaf2-b13a4db7ec43",
                                "text": "The Bigfoot of spiders has been discovered in the caves of southwestern Oregon."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "beac6bec-af2c-4f4d-ada0-3aff2710b3a0",
                                "sense_id": "e58f52e5-e2c7-3651-aaf2-b13a4db7ec43",
                                "text": "Then there are the sharp divisions of opinion about whether Bigfoot is a Gigantopithecus or a Neanderthal or some other hominid."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e9db8d40-2c18-49e8-9861-b8b91109ebca",
                                "sense_id": "e58f52e5-e2c7-3651-aaf2-b13a4db7ec43",
                                "text": "Many enthusiasts believe that Bigfoot is not some sort of undiscovered hominid, but rather a mystical being that moves between dimensions."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "bc51bbf0-7f0d-481a-b3e1-13e615d73249",
                        "source_entry_id": "d941fa36-0d07-3781-b40b-705b630aeb2b",
                        "source_sense_id": "e58f52e5-e2c7-3651-aaf2-b13a4db7ec43",
